{"id":"00077","root":"uni00077_1","name":{"ja":"ふうま　時子","en":"Fuuma Tokiko"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"ふうま　時子","en":"Fuuma Tokiko"},"element":"Spiritual","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2019-09-25","limited":true,"characterId":63,"profile":{"ja":"ふうま小太郎の執事を務める対魔忍。主人公・小太郎の父・弾正が妾に産ませた子、つまり主人公の腹ちがいの姉。生まれるとすぐふうまの家に代々仕えている執事の家に養女に出され、以後ずっとふうまの陰日向となり支えている。主人公の事は“お館様”と呼ぶ。高い近接戦闘能力も持ち、ふうま一族最高のクナイ使いと評されている。また、ふうま一族の特徴をしっかり受け継ぎ、彼女も邪眼使いである。目を閉じた時に発動する彼女の邪眼は“千里眼”と呼ばれ、視覚だけを遊離してどこへでも自由自在に潜入できるというもの。遊離した視覚で本やコンピュータなどの情報端末に触れれば、そこに記されている情報を読む事もできる。","en":"Fuuma Tokiko serves as the butler of Fuuma Kotaro. She is the illegitimate older sister of the protagonist, born to Kotaro's father Danjo, who fathered her with a concubine. Shortly after birth she was placed with the family of butlers who have served the Fuuma line for generations, becoming an adopted daughter and ever-present shadow supporting the Fuuma household. She refers to the protagonist as \"Lord.\" Tokiko possesses high close-combat skill and is praised as the Fuuma clan's finest kunai user. She also inherited the clan's hallmark—her evil eye. When she closes her eyes, her \"Thousand-Mile Eye\" activates, detaching her vision and allowing her to infiltrate any location at will. With this detached sight she can read information from books, computers, or any data terminal she touches."},"illustrator":"カガミ","voiceActor":"向井れん","forms":[{"id":"uni00077_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1406,2812],"sp":[160,160],"atk":[198,396],"def":[148,296],"spd":[85,85],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["3","330001"]},{"id":"uni00077_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[2012,4024],"sp":[230,230],"atk":[296,592],"def":[196,392],"spd":[85,85],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["3","330001","330002"]},{"id":"uni00077_3","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","levelMax":100,"stats":{"hp":[2618,5261],"sp":[330,330],"atk":[394,786],"def":[244